    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point-and-Click Platformer</strong>: In this unique platforming adventure, Players guide the deaf dog Stella through a wide variety of environments in her goal to reach the end of each level. Stella will need you to <i>point</i> where you'd like her to go, not control her directly. Remember, she can't hear you, but she can see where you point. While Stella is pretty smart, she needs your help to navigate complex or challenging puzzles. Run, jump, crawl, and climb through all the courses!\u00a0Just don't forget to hydrate! Stella runs slower and jumps lower when she's too thirsty.<br><br><strong>Dress for Success</strong>: Stella can equip several different collars while adventuring. Each one provides a unique bonus. For example the Red Collar makes her run faster, and the Green Collar makes her jump higher.<br><br><strong>Collect all Bones:</strong>\u00a0In each level there are tons of bones to collect. Some are more hidden than others. Collect all the bones in each level to unlock more lore about the real world Stella.<br><br><strong>Compete with Speed</strong>: Each level has a starting amount of points, which ticks down over time. Collecting bones awards more points, and completing the level quickly will keep your score intact. Balance speed with exploration to maximize your run score.<br><br><strong>Discover new Friends:\u00a0</strong>\u00a0In some levels Stella can discover new friends, which can be visited in the Dog Park from the main menu. All Dogs are based on real world dogs as well.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point-and-Click Platformer</strong>: In this unique platforming adventure, Players guide the deaf dog Stella through a wide variety of environments in her goal to reach the end of each level. Stella will need you to <i>point</i> where you'd like her to go, not control her directly. Remember, she can't hear you, but she can see where you point. While Stella is pretty smart, she needs your help to navigate complex or challenging puzzles. Run, jump, crawl, and climb through all the courses!\u00a0Just don't forget to hydrate! Stella runs slower and jumps lower when she's too thirsty.<br><br><strong>Dress for Success</strong>: Stella can equip several different collars while adventuring. Each one provides a unique bonus. For example the Red Collar makes her run faster, and the Green Collar makes her jump higher.<br><br><strong>Collect all Bones:</strong>\u00a0In each level there are tons of bones to collect. Some are more hidden than others. Collect all the bones in each level to unlock more lore about the real world Stella.<br><br><strong>Compete with Speed</strong>: Each level has a starting amount of points, which ticks down over time. Collecting bones awards more points, and completing the level quickly will keep your score intact. Balance speed with exploration to maximize your run score.<br><br><strong>Discover new Friends:\u00a0</strong>\u00a0In some levels Stella can discover new friends, which can be visited in the Dog Park from the main menu. All Dogs are based on real world dogs as well.\u00a0</p>",
